                                "sense_id": "e65695b3-8ad7-31d8-926b-b00fcd637836",
                                "text": "Unitarian Universalists urge reflection upon outworn religious assumptions and propose a serious religious alternative that affirms reason, science, human intuition and lived experience as profoundly as it affirms ancient religious traditions."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
